    {
      "id": "industrial-build-up-02",
      "scene": "industrial-build-up",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Foundry Beta refined metal and made beams. Even the largest frame could cross the distance to the next workshop in pieces.",
      "startSeconds": 138,
      "endSeconds": 145.917,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 7.917,
      "characters": 122,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 122,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/industrial-build-up-02-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "industrial-build-up-03",
      "scene": "industrial-build-up",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "At Foundry Gamma, those pieces came together. A frame made here could carry a precision instrument brought from another star.",
      "startSeconds": 150,
      "endSeconds": 157.746,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 7.746,
      "characters": 125,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 125,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/industrial-build-up-03-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "industrial-build-up-04",
      "scene": "industrial-build-up",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Depots held cargo until the next transfer. The workshops could keep different schedules.",
      "startSeconds": 162,
      "endSeconds": 167.957,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.957,
      "characters": 88,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 88,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/industrial-build-up-04-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "industrial-build-up-05",
      "scene": "industrial-build-up",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "A fourth branch was called Foundry Delta. Its precise role remains uncertain.",
      "startSeconds": 170,
      "endSeconds": 175.476,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.476,
      "characters": 77,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 77,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/industrial-build-up-05-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "infrastructure-01",
      "scene": "infrastructure",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "By now the Company could supply equipment in Earth orbit. From below, an object arriving there gave little indication of the industry behind it.",
      "startSeconds": 178,
      "endSeconds": 186.836,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8.836,
      "characters": 144,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 144,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/infrastructure-01-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "infrastructure-02",
      "scene": "infrastructure",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Some of these objects entered human tracking records. A track could establish where something had been, and where to look for it again.",
      "startSeconds": 191,
      "endSeconds": 199.324,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8.324,
      "characters": 135,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 135,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/infrastructure-02-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "infrastructure-03",
      "scene": "infrastructure",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "What it carried, who had built it, and why it was there were harder questions.",
      "startSeconds": 204,
      "endSeconds": 208.884,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 4.884,
      "characters": 78,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 78,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/infrastructure-03-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-01",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "With ninety days left before contact, the workshops began handing over finished equipment.",
      "startSeconds": 214,
      "endSeconds": 219.806,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.806,
      "characters": 90,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 90,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-01-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-02",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Near Earth, cargo from the Moon’s neighbourhood began to appear in separate groups in orbit.",
      "startSeconds": 220,
      "endSeconds": 225.459,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.459,
      "characters": 92,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 92,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-02-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-03",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Among it were Quivers: disposable dispensers carrying the glide munitions of the opening Wave.",
      "startSeconds": 228,
      "endSeconds": 233.9,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.9,
      "characters": 94,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 94,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-03-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-04",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "A tug could spend weeks moving freight. There was time because the public deadline was still ahead.",
      "startSeconds": 235,
      "endSeconds": 240.864,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.864,
      "characters": 99,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 99,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
