      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-08",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "At an observatory, two exposures might show a point of light changing position. The measurement could be sound while its meaning remained unclear.",
      "startSeconds": 263,
      "endSeconds": 271.431,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 8.431,
      "characters": 146,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 146,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-08-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-09",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "The scattered observations never became a warning governments could act on. The people comparing them had only pieces of the picture.",
      "startSeconds": 272,
      "endSeconds": 279.638,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 7.638,
      "characters": 133,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 133,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-09-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-10",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Domesday sensors covered selected ground corridors. Much of the terrain remained unseen.",
      "startSeconds": 280,
      "endSeconds": 285.853,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.853,
      "characters": 88,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 88,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-10-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-11",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "In the final weeks, the workshops kept working as more of their output took its place above Earth.",
      "startSeconds": 287,
      "endSeconds": 292.924,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.924,
      "characters": 98,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 98,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-11-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-12",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "One dispenser had already been set aside for a demonstration. Its public announcement would come later.",
      "startSeconds": 295,
      "endSeconds": 301.77,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 6.77,
      "characters": 103,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 103,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-12-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-13",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "An inert Scythe would give observers a prediction to check. The event was still ahead.",
      "startSeconds": 302,
      "endSeconds": 306.96,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 4.96,
      "characters": 86,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 86,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
      "model": null,
      "settings": null,
      "sourceService": "ElevenLabs",
      "version": 1,
      "approval": "awaiting paid-take approval",
      "outputPath": "assets/audio/voices/narrator/final-staging-13-v001.wav",
      "originalPath": null,
      "gainDb": 0,
      "fadeInSeconds": 0,
      "fadeOutSeconds": 0,
      "license": null
    },
    {
      "id": "final-staging-14",
      "scene": "final-staging",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Nineteen months had passed since the Caravan arrived. On Earth, the first public word was still to come.",
      "startSeconds": 309,
      "endSeconds": 315.782,
      "targetDurationSeconds": 6.782,
      "characters": 104,
      "estimatedBaseCredits": 104,
      "voiceId": "6FiCmD8eY5VyjOdG5Zjk",
